Z||000009||ChadMan||01-24-2000||09:33 AM||||While attending Ohio State, I worked the late shift at their fine student newspaper.  During the 1993-94 winter, we had a cold snap where the actual temp (not wind chill) got down to 24 below.  When I and the two girls I was working with got out to our cars around midnight, my 84 Fiero was the only one of the three cars that would start!  I drove them home - they had to share the passenger seat!||||reg||7
